---
// CollabSection.astro: Invitation to collaborate and inquiry generator
---

<section class="section collab-section" id="contact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="collab-block">
      <div class="collab-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">LET'S ASK THE NEXT QUESTION</div>
        <h2 class="collab-title">
          下一个值得研究的问题，<br>
          也许来自你。
        </h2>
        <p class="collab-desc">
          数据库与智能系统、科研合作、高校联合研究。<br>
          从一个真实的问题，开始一次有意义的合作。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="collab-action">
        <a href="/contact" class="button button-primary">
          开启一次对话 <span class="arrow">&nearr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .collab-section {
    padding-block: 80px 100px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 5;
  }

  .collab-block {
    padding: 70px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .collab-title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.2vw, 42px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .collab-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 16px;
    line-height: 2;
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .collab-action .button {
    white-space: nowrap;
    min-width: 190px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .collab-block {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 30px;
      padding: 50px 0;
    }
  }
</style>
